    "detailed_description": "<strong>Retro Space Ball</strong> is a truly unique action <strong>pinball shooter</strong> with multiple game modes including <strong>Story Mode, Pinball Mode</strong> and <strong>Local PVP</strong>. Speed through solar systems full of <strong> alien obstacles, giant robots </strong>and <strong>powerups </strong>all while navigating a <strong>powerful energy orb</strong> in to a space aged combustion chamber, destroying planet sized powerplants scattered throughout the galaxy.<br><br>Explore the unknown in outer space or complete linear missions!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499280/extras/ae9c91b4746589ef19c97f9c271f9344.poster.avif?t=1725580229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499280/extras/ae9c91b4746589ef19c97f9c271f9344.webm?t=1725580229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499280/extras/ae9c91b4746589ef19c97f9c271f9344.mp4?t=1725580229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features Include</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Physics Based</strong> Gameplay!<br></li><li>Beautifully Animated SNES Era <strong>Pixel Graphics</strong>!<br></li><li>Retro <strong>Chiptune </strong>Soundtrack!<br></li><li><strong>GIANT </strong>Bosses!<br></li><li><strong>VS AI</strong> and <strong>Local PVP</strong> Modes!<br></li><li><strong>Pinball </strong>Table Mode!<br></li><li><strong>Upgradable </strong>Ships!</li></ul><br>Join the <strong>Retro Space Ball Community Discord Server!</strong><br>...Where you can access the current state of the game!",
